---
---

<section class="section issue" data-transition-to="issue" aria-labelledby="issue-title">
  <div class="issue__inner">
    <p class="issue__label" data-reveal>Issue</p>

    <h2 class="issue__lead" id="issue-title" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.05">
      いいものなのに、それが画面では伝わらない。
    </h2>

    <p class="issue__body" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.12">
      写真と文章を並べても、いちばん伝えたい空気感は、こぼれ落ちてしまう。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .issue {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* コピーの裏に、境界がふわっとぼけた暗だまりを敷いて白文字を読みやすくする。 */
  .issue::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(
      58% 40% at 50% 50%,
      rgba(6, 7, 11, 0.6) 0%,
      rgba(6, 7, 11, 0.4) 44%,
      rgba(6, 7, 11, 0.16) 72%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    filter: blur(16px);
  }

  .issue__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: none;
    padding-inline: var(--gutter);
  }

  .issue__label {
    margin: 0 0 1.8rem;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 14px rgba(20, 45, 80, 0.5);
  }

  .issue__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .issue__body {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 2.1;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 18px rgba(20, 45, 80, 0.55);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .issue__lead,
    .issue__body {
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }
</style>
